{"articleNo":"419949","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=419949&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] 2023학년도 계약학과 학사 편입학 모집 안내(산업체 재직자 과정)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.12.13","hit":"5428","attachments":[{"name":"2023학년도_계약학과_학사_편입학_모집요강.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=419949&attachNo=119507"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; line-height: 1.625rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: keep-all; letter-spacing: -0.25px;\"><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학년도 금오공과대학교 계약학과 학부 편입학 모집요강 자료입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모집기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:  <b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">2022. 12. 1.(</span></b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">) ~ 12. 30.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">) 17</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">시까지</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">접수방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">방문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우편&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; * </span><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">경북 구미시 대학로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">61 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">산학협력관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">501</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">호</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">서명란이 있는 서식은 가급적 <b>원본 제출</b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">2) 계약서 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;- 계약학과 설치 운영 계약서<b> <span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">2부 제출</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp;- \"경상북도 계약학과 지원사업\" 3자 계약서<b> <span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">3부 제출</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">졸업예정자의 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">추후 확정서류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">졸업증명서 및 성적증명서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제출 필수</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">미제출시 입학 취소 처리 될 수 있음</span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">4) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">기업 대표자 입학지원 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: normal;\">[한국산업인력공단]&nbsp;</span>사업주훈련과정 계약학과(해당학과: 산업경영공학과)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">상시근로자 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1000</span></b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><b>인 미만 기업</b>이 근로자의직무능력향상을 위하여 대학과 계약을 통해 설치</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">운영하는 교육과정으로&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">중소계열 상 이</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">공계학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">전문학사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">            해당하는 과정으로 근로자의 직무와 직접적 관련성이 있는 경우에만&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지원가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교육수료기준</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><b><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">출석률 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">80%</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(15</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일기준 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일 이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">대표자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">상시근로자수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1000</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">인이상업체 재직자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고용보험미가입자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">수강신청변경자는 환급 제외</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\">  &nbsp;  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">문의처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 054-478-6733</span></p></pre>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
